			"• 専用武器ポジトロンレーザーが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Digimon Adventure 02\", \"Imperialdramon\", which can transform into two forms, is now available as an Amplified Arrangement Plastic Model!",
			"• Cooperation with official designer Kenji Watanabe.",
			"• \"Fighter mode\" and \"Dragon mode\" can be reproduced by replacing and expanding and contracting each part.",
